passion determination and world-class  talent those are the qualities of an  olympic champion  including one of our very own las vegas  native bo  becker was part of a gold medal winning  swim relay team in tokyo  orco mana speaking to his family tonight  and orco joins us live with his unlikely  journey  to the top  well brian for swimming star boat becker  the road from las vegas  to the olympics in tokyo has not been  easy but his brothers tell me his big  win this week  means so much more than a medal  when i saw him when the gold medal  teared up  a little bit so it was a really  beautiful moment beau becker's brothers  are beyond  proud of him the 24 year old first time  olympian and faith lutheran graduate  celebrating a first place finish after a  stellar swim  in the 4x100 freestyle relay but his  trip to tokyo was far from a walk in the  park  his journey has been it's been a long  and brutal one  beau has rheumatoid arthritis which  means his immune system attacks his own  joints  diagnosed when he was around 12 years  old he actually started swimming as a  way to help his condition  his older brother brandon telling me  even making the olympics was a miracle  he's almost given up several points and  just kept going it's been a testament to  his  tenacity and strength as a person bose  went with the sandpipers club in las  vegas and broke swimming records in high  school and college but last year  he almost gave up the sport he's just  stopped swimming all together  the youngest becker brother cameron says  beau waited tables at a restaurant in  reno for six months but his passion for  swimming returned  leading him to the world's biggest stage  it's amazing to be able to look up to  someone of his caliber  and that i'm also related to him it's  surreal bose brothers hope he serves as  an inspiration to kids everywhere  battling illness or adversity and never  giving up  will get you good results in life  and maybe a gold medal  now beau was only scheduled to compete  in the 4x100 freestyle relay at the  olympics  but his brothers tell me that team usa  might also add him to a different relay  reporting live from downtown las vegas  tonight orco mana 8 news now
 

